WEBVTT

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:09.878
In order to give the turtle to mr. Albert,
Candy secretly escaped from the contemplation room.

00:00:10.684 --> 00:00:14.611
It turned out that Terry was at Albert's place, too.

00:00:15.003 --> 00:00:19.046
Candy got into a fight with Terry over Anthony.

00:00:21.374 --> 00:00:26.865
Mr. Albert was very disappointed when he found out
that Candy was banned from the May festival.

00:00:27.914 --> 00:00:32.377
And so, the day of May festival is finally here.

00:00:33.497 --> 00:00:39.423
Fairy of the school festival.

00:01:23.276 --> 00:01:24.604
So pretty.

00:01:25.198 --> 00:01:28.377
I was supposed to be on that float.

00:01:42.818 --> 00:01:44.616
Poor Candy.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.148
Can't you help her with some invention?

00:01:51.522 --> 00:01:54.972
I could've gotten a good idea, if I had more time...

00:01:55.187 --> 00:01:57.965
-So you're saying that it's impossible?
-Exactly.

00:01:59.347 --> 00:02:06.397
-I can't have any fun knowing that Candy is so unhappy.
-We too.

00:02:16.129 --> 00:02:16.935
Candy!

00:02:17.724 --> 00:02:18.744
Patty!

00:02:20.866 --> 00:02:23.683
They'll scold you if they find you here!

00:02:24.475 --> 00:02:26.896
But... this was my fault, I'm sorry...

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.623
-I've taken care of Yuli.
-How?

00:02:31.812 --> 00:02:33.529
I escaped through that window.

00:02:35.827 --> 00:02:36.707
Candy!

00:02:37.538 --> 00:02:40.609
Don't worry, Yuli is in very good hands.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.896
Candy, thank you!

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:49.315
Now, Patty, leave quickly
before somebody sees you.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.788
-I brought you a package and a letter which arrived for you!
-For me?

00:02:53.543 --> 00:02:54.144
Here.

00:02:54.946 --> 00:02:57.437
I brought it to you because I thought
you'd be impatient to see what it was!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.374
Thank you!

00:02:59.605 --> 00:03:00.980
Well then, Candy, I'm off!

00:03:01.908 --> 00:03:03.257
Thank you, Patty!

00:03:09.138 --> 00:03:10.348
I wonder who sent it...

00:03:11.052 --> 00:03:13.143
It's from grandfather William!

00:03:16.788 --> 00:03:21.931
Miss Candice White Adley,
Mr. William is unable to attend because of work.

00:03:22.075 --> 00:03:24.906
To compensate for this, he ordered me to
send you these dresses.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:31.004
Mr. William is delighted with the fact that you
are becoming a beautiful lady.

00:03:31.005 --> 00:03:31.873
George.

00:03:32.499 --> 00:03:36.325
I'm so glad! Grandfather William isn't mad.

00:03:42.337 --> 00:03:44.006
Huh? What kind of costumes are these?

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:46.524
A male and a female costume packed next to each other.

00:03:47.233 --> 00:03:49.752
They look like they are for Romeo and Juliet.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.536
There's even a wig in here!

00:03:53.535 --> 00:03:59.626
Men's clothes... maybe grandfather William
couldn't remember if I was a boy or a girl?

00:04:01.002 --> 00:04:02.754
But it's a good idea!

00:04:16.472 --> 00:04:20.369
-Terrius!
-What's the meaning of this?

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:24.829
-Terrius!
-That's strange. He'll participate in May festival?

00:04:25.692 --> 00:04:27.429
Where'd she go?

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.951
She appears to have slipped
out of the contemplation room...

00:04:29.952 --> 00:04:33.032
Don't tell me that she simply
waltzed into this hall...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:36.926
-I had a feeling that she would've escaped...
-Terrius.

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:41.400
I'm looking for a dance partner.
Won't you dance with me?

00:04:42.679 --> 00:04:47.529
Oh, I'm honoured. But I have a bad habit
of stepping on one's feet while dancing.

00:04:47.608 --> 00:04:50.290
Lady, it would've been inexcusable
of me to step on your feet.

00:04:50.291 --> 00:04:51.854
Please, find a different partner.

00:04:52.974 --> 00:04:57.916
What a guy! Neil was right about him.
But he called me a lady...

00:05:09.558 --> 00:05:11.478
Maybe this is a good place to jump down.

00:05:13.962 --> 00:05:21.459
-May festival is going smoothly.
-I don't want this ruckus to turn into a tradition.

00:05:26.113 --> 00:05:27.121
Excuse me!

00:05:27.639 --> 00:05:30.810
That boy... I don't remember
seeing him in our school...

00:05:39.323 --> 00:05:41.645
Dangerous, dangerous...!
I'd better keep my cover.

00:05:42.154 --> 00:05:44.756
But not even sister Gray noticed!

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.062
Annie?

00:06:05.654 --> 00:06:08.225
-Miss, would you like to dance?
-But...

00:06:09.748 --> 00:06:11.313
Annie, it's me!

00:06:12.631 --> 00:06:14.145
Candy!

00:06:25.969 --> 00:06:28.620
I'm glad you escaped!

00:06:30.651 --> 00:06:34.549
Say, Annie... do you remember?
Back when we were little...

00:06:35.402 --> 00:06:37.158
We were always together!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.014
We held each others' hands like this
and ran around Pony's hill!

00:06:41.819 --> 00:06:43.425
Candy, you!

00:06:46.538 --> 00:06:47.472
Sorry.

00:06:47.846 --> 00:06:51.173
-Say, who is dancing with Annie?
-Dunno...

00:06:51.957 --> 00:06:53.395
He's handsome!

00:06:56.113 --> 00:06:58.981
Now that Candy isn't around,
Annie is getting all the attention.

00:07:01.032 --> 00:07:03.596
Archie, I thought that
you were dancing with Annie!

00:07:08.918 --> 00:07:11.178
He's handsome! Who is he?

00:07:17.163 --> 00:07:22.777
-Hey... let's trade places.
-Oh, Archie! You're welcome!

00:07:22.846 --> 00:07:24.395
Who was he?

00:07:33.556 --> 00:07:35.850
-Stear! It's me!
-Hah?

00:07:37.735 --> 00:07:41.704
-What a surprise!
-It's a present from grandfather William!

00:07:41.809 --> 00:07:43.742
The costumes of Romeo and Juliet.

00:07:45.415 --> 00:07:48.416
Grandfather William sure gives out
some strange presents!

00:07:49.521 --> 00:07:51.210
I was able to come here because of him!

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.223
-I'd like to tell you some news.
-What?

00:07:55.382 --> 00:07:59.551
See, thanks to grandfather William,
aunt Elroy didn't get mad for what happened.

00:07:59.607 --> 00:08:02.605
Really?
Now I can dance without worry!

00:08:04.427 --> 00:08:05.191
Stear?

00:08:06.434 --> 00:08:08.939
Isn't it boring for two guys to dance together?

00:08:08.972 --> 00:08:12.537
-Won't you dance with Louise?
-Please.

00:08:12.986 --> 00:08:14.471
Uh... I will.

00:08:20.507 --> 00:08:22.094
Won't you dance with me?

00:08:22.156 --> 00:08:26.713
I'm very sorry, miss, but I just remembered something - -
Please, pick another partner.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:30.484
He's avoiding me, exactly like Terrius.

00:08:31.086 --> 00:08:32.828
But... who was he?

00:08:50.002 --> 00:08:54.670
-Disguising as Romeo was a huge success!
-Candy!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.500
How did she escape from the contemplation room?

00:08:58.277 --> 00:09:02.507
That's right... what will happen if I blow
her cover in front of everybody?

00:09:09.233 --> 00:09:11.782
Now, let's change into Juliet.

00:09:15.452 --> 00:09:18.885
This is much more fun than just dancing!

00:09:19.036 --> 00:09:21.258
Grandfather William, I'm so grateful!

00:09:23.523 --> 00:09:27.520
This dress doesn't restrain me; If I get into trouble,
I'll be able to make a run for it!

00:09:28.008 --> 00:09:30.340
Now, back to the hall!

00:09:30.845 --> 00:09:33.130
Nobody will know that I broke free
from the contemplation room.

00:09:33.463 --> 00:09:34.897
Let's go!

00:09:39.192 --> 00:09:41.912
Did you bring a monkey costume, too?
Freckled Tarzan.

00:09:43.148 --> 00:09:47.762
Te-Terrius!
You were watching while I was changing?

00:09:48.573 --> 00:09:51.037
You were in my sight,
but I wasn't looking.

00:09:51.826 --> 00:09:52.972
You're rude!

00:09:52.973 --> 00:09:53.892
On a different note,

00:09:56.089 --> 00:09:58.198
...Eliza found out the secret of Romeo.

00:09:58.867 --> 00:10:00.836
Eliza?

00:10:00.848 --> 00:10:03.221
Say, have you prepared the contemplation room?

00:10:03.819 --> 00:10:06.136
I made it look like I was in bed...

00:10:11.099 --> 00:10:12.535
You'll be okay then.

00:10:13.111 --> 00:10:16.479
Eliza won't be coming back. For the time being,
let's go to your Pony's hill.

00:10:16.514 --> 00:10:17.309
Okay.

00:10:30.323 --> 00:10:31.799
What a wonderful day!

00:10:33.415 --> 00:10:35.367
I feel great!

00:10:40.575 --> 00:10:44.149
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
I believe that the year is 1913 and that Candy
turns 15 in May. I also flunked my maths so...

00:10:49.023 --> 00:10:51.362
I once went for a picnic on a day like this.

00:10:52.904 --> 00:10:55.168
I was two or maybe three years old...

00:10:55.746 --> 00:11:00.247
I don't remember very well, but the sky looked
exactly like this. And I played cheerfully.

00:11:02.242 --> 00:11:06.729
The smiles of my dad and mom - their happiness
is the only memory that hasn't faded with time.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:12.585
Mom... actress Eleanor Baker.

00:11:13.443 --> 00:11:17.876
She must have been a gentle, wonderful mother.

00:11:19.088 --> 00:11:21.260
Those are beautiful memories! I'm jealous!

00:11:21.431 --> 00:11:23.133
I only remember that day.

00:11:23.782 --> 00:11:27.087
Remembering just one day is enough!
On the other hand, I don't have any memories!

00:11:27.632 --> 00:11:32.137
-Say, Terry, promise we'll go for a picnic one day!
-Candy.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.650
This is...

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.815
I danced with Anthony to this music.

00:11:50.708 --> 00:11:51.784
It's a nice melody.

00:11:54.189 --> 00:11:57.096
It would be my honour, princess Juliet!
May I ask for a dance?

00:12:08.165 --> 00:12:13.369
Memories are coming back... this green grass...
sunlight streaming through leaves...

00:12:14.494 --> 00:12:16.069
But the one who's here is Terry.

00:12:16.483 --> 00:12:17.280
But...

00:12:17.522 --> 00:12:19.442
He has Anthony's gentle smile.

00:12:22.893 --> 00:12:23.750
What's the matter?

00:12:24.052 --> 00:12:27.233
I danced with Anthony for the first time
to this music...

00:12:30.254 --> 00:12:31.138
Terry?

00:12:33.002 --> 00:12:34.159
Anthony again?

00:12:34.356 --> 00:12:36.137
Please stop comparing me to him!

00:12:36.995 --> 00:12:38.207
Terry!

00:12:40.869 --> 00:12:43.268
He's dead! He fell off a horse and died!

00:12:44.098 --> 00:12:45.436
Don't say that, Terry!

00:12:46.618 --> 00:12:48.653
The dead don't come back to life!

00:12:49.457 --> 00:12:53.214
Stop! I hate you!
Terry, I hate you!

00:12:53.739 --> 00:12:58.030
Yes! You keep thinking about that dead guy - -
I hate people who are like that!

00:13:10.164 --> 00:13:13.932
-Eliza, are you sure it was Candy?
-Of course I am!

00:13:13.967 --> 00:13:15.527
Maybe you were mistaken?

00:13:16.363 --> 00:13:19.713
Anyway, wait and see.
I'll tear the mask off your face.

00:13:27.175 --> 00:13:31.727
Eliza... she thinks I'm still wearing the Romeo costume.
Didn't notice me at all!

00:13:37.225 --> 00:13:40.340
-Stear! Archie!
-Candy!

00:13:42.436 --> 00:13:43.457
I'm Juliet.

00:13:44.329 --> 00:13:46.330
Candy, this costume suits you better.

00:13:47.599 --> 00:13:49.662
Many people have gathered in the garden.

00:13:49.723 --> 00:13:52.329
Yes, the guests are pouring in.

00:13:54.745 --> 00:14:00.348
The guests... I feel so sorry for mr. Albert!
He looked so disappointed.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:04.145
I always wanted to see him in dress clothes!

00:14:07.184 --> 00:14:09.172
Patty is alone?

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.111
-Patty!
-Ca...!

00:14:12.994 --> 00:14:14.514
You escaped just to come here?

00:14:14.868 --> 00:14:18.991
-Your grandmother didn't come?
-Yes, she had some urgent matters to sort out...

00:14:19.161 --> 00:14:21.420
But now that you're here, I won't be alone anymore!

00:14:21.561 --> 00:14:26.106
-I promised that I'd introduce you to Stear.
-Candy...!

00:14:27.626 --> 00:14:29.940
Now, princess Juliet, the dance is about to begin!

00:14:29.941 --> 00:14:31.044
Hurry, hurry!

00:14:31.451 --> 00:14:32.999
Uh, Stear!

00:14:33.448 --> 00:14:36.119
Sorry, I'll introduce you two when the dance is over.

00:15:05.689 --> 00:15:09.854
Nobody was able to tell that I'm Candy.
This is so much fun!

00:15:15.448 --> 00:15:17.070
Patty and Stear are dancing together!

00:15:26.505 --> 00:15:28.732
-Forgive me...
-Uh, me too...

00:15:28.912 --> 00:15:32.623
-Uh, my glasses fell somewhere around here...
-And my glasses...

00:15:32.715 --> 00:15:35.430
-You wear glasses too?
-Yes.

00:15:38.845 --> 00:15:42.456
You look so cute without glasses!

00:15:42.857 --> 00:15:46.021
...and you look very handsome this way!

00:15:47.401 --> 00:15:49.252
In that case, let's dance like this!

00:15:51.552 --> 00:15:55.079
-Hey, the two of you, won't you move aside a bit?
-That's right, you're bothering others.

00:15:59.937 --> 00:16:02.223
And I still haven't introduced them to each other.

00:16:07.109 --> 00:16:11.032
-Eliza, Candy isn't going to come.
-This is strange...

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.399
Maybe you were mistaken, after all?

00:16:15.188 --> 00:16:18.409
That's right. We can't be sure unless
we take a look into the contemplation room.

00:16:18.548 --> 00:16:20.097
But you can't freely go up there!

00:16:20.798 --> 00:16:21.932
Leave it to me!

00:16:29.009 --> 00:16:33.283
-Bro, you're a great dancer!
-But you know...

00:16:35.248 --> 00:16:36.385
Sister Gray!

00:16:40.865 --> 00:16:43.245
-You'd better hide.
-It's okay!

00:16:52.354 --> 00:16:53.487
Sister Gray!

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.705
Sister Gray, we'd like to ask you something.

00:16:58.733 --> 00:16:59.818
What is it?

00:17:00.022 --> 00:17:04.068
We'd like to take some fruit to Candy
who is locked up in the contemplation room.

00:17:06.513 --> 00:17:08.304
Poor Candy...

00:17:09.185 --> 00:17:10.114
Very well.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:13.570
I'll respect your kind thoughts.
You have my approval.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.623
We can open the cell and go inside?

00:17:16.624 --> 00:17:17.317
Yes.

00:17:17.868 --> 00:17:22.671
But don't talk to her too long.
You mustn't interrupt her contemplation.

00:17:23.029 --> 00:17:24.462
-Yes, sister Gray!
-Yes, sister Gray!

00:17:27.512 --> 00:17:28.635
This is bad!

00:17:28.802 --> 00:17:32.248
Candy, you must return to the contemplation room
before Eliza gets there!

00:17:32.477 --> 00:17:35.777
We'll try to hold them off a bit!

00:17:36.112 --> 00:17:37.863
-Candy, hurry!
-Yes!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:48.056
Just wait and see.
There's no way that Candy is in there.

00:17:48.091 --> 00:17:49.103
Eliza!

00:17:49.677 --> 00:17:50.736
Wait!

00:17:50.944 --> 00:17:53.599
-What is it?
-Are you going to see Candy?

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.778
It doesn't concern you where we are going.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.237
Won't you let us go as well?

00:17:58.277 --> 00:18:01.677
I'll ask for permission, could you wait a bit?

00:18:02.142 --> 00:18:03.447
Fishy.

00:18:03.892 --> 00:18:06.787
Stop trying to hold us off
to buy her time!

00:18:08.099 --> 00:18:09.161
Eliza!

00:18:09.724 --> 00:18:10.903
Wait!

00:18:22.818 --> 00:18:24.471
Please! Eliza, wait!

00:18:24.849 --> 00:18:25.987
Shut up!

00:18:43.628 --> 00:18:45.891
Damn! Turned up just a second too late!

00:18:47.154 --> 00:18:47.991
Candy!

00:18:49.021 --> 00:18:51.694
...of course, you're not going to answer.

00:18:52.165 --> 00:18:54.046
She must be sound asleep.

00:18:54.474 --> 00:18:57.401
We can't know like this.
That is, unless I uncover her.

00:19:05.096 --> 00:19:07.212
See, she is here!

00:19:07.853 --> 00:19:10.737
Eliza, you were mistaken, after all.

00:19:11.391 --> 00:19:13.479
I'm sure she escaped somehow!

00:19:13.571 --> 00:19:14.955
I won't forget this, Candy!

00:19:21.772 --> 00:19:23.457
This was close!

00:19:23.835 --> 00:19:25.163
Candy!

00:19:25.805 --> 00:19:28.238
Then... who is in your bed?

00:19:37.315 --> 00:19:38.753
Terrius?

00:19:39.158 --> 00:19:40.480
Just what I thought!

00:19:42.187 --> 00:19:45.102
You would've been in trouble if I hadn't
taken precaution, Freckled Tarzan!

00:19:46.376 --> 00:19:48.984
I snuck in here since I expected that
something like this would've happened.

00:19:50.648 --> 00:19:51.881
Thank you, Terry!

00:20:18.063 --> 00:20:19.380
Candy!

00:20:29.383 --> 00:20:30.732
I finally found you!

00:20:30.733 --> 00:20:33.504
You're supposed to be in a contemplation room,
what are you doing here then?

00:20:33.832 --> 00:20:35.751
I allowed her to.

00:20:38.068 --> 00:20:39.309
Sister Gray!

00:20:42.024 --> 00:20:47.206
Terrius G. Grandchester was the director of
this year's school festival.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:54.013
Now that the festival is over, Candice White Adley
is free to join us and participate in all activities.

00:20:56.491 --> 00:20:57.305
Candy!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:58.441
I'm so glad!

00:21:02.372 --> 00:21:06.136
Thank you!
Everybody, thank you!

00:21:10.778 --> 00:21:17.863
Just like a firestorm, the flame of resistance
burned brightly in Candy's heart.

00:21:19.106 --> 00:21:22.365
To be continued...
